{"id":"79b1f4eaf53c0045","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-krandom.md","title":"Weakly K-Random Finite Strings","display":"df-krandom — Weakly K-Random Finite Strings","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-krandom","aliases":["43-df-krandom"],"display":"df-krandom — Weakly K-Random Finite Strings","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.11, weakly Chaitin random finite strings","source_printed_pages":"108–109","source_pdf_pages":"128–129","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-krandom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-krandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-krandom — Weakly K-Random Finite Strings"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.11, weakly Chaitin random finite strings"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"108–109"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"128–129"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KRandom}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KRandom}(\\sigma,c)\\leftrightarrow K(\\sigma)\\ge|\\sigma|-c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KRandom}(\\sigma,c)\\leftrightarrow K(\\sigma)\\ge|\\sigma|-c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>明确这是草稿所称的弱有限串 K 随机性；强版本需要额外的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(|\\sigma|)\">\\(K(|\\sigma|)\\)</span>，另见 df-strong-krandom。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.11, weakly Chaitin random finite strings；印刷页 108–109，PDF 页 128–129。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*$，$c\\in\\mathbb N$；$K$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KRandom}(\\sigma,c)\\leftrightarrow K(\\sigma)\\ge|\\sigma|-c.","display":true},{"tex":"K(|\\sigma|)","display":false}],"bytes":1266,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-krandom]] — Weakly K-Random Finite Strings"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848"]}